False	! Flag for performing only single scatter (FO) radiative transfer, no multiple scattering (MS)
False	! Flag for performing a vector calculation
True	! Flag for calculating the radiance at the desired viewing geometry
False	! Flag for calculating actinic fluxes at observer altitude additionally.
False	! Flag for calculating actinic flux profiles (disabled by the Python wrapper)
True	! Flag for Rayleigh only. If true, only moment order 0 to 2 are considered for scattering phasefunction.
False	! Flag for using deltaM Scaling (normally true with MS contributions and aerosols)
4	! Number of discrete ordinate streams
4	! Subdivision of layers for full-sphericity calculations
500.0	! Observer height [m]
6371.0	! Planet radius [km]
85.0	! Solar zenith angle
89	! Viewing zenith angle
90.0	! Relative azimuth angle
True	! Flag for radiance jacobian calculations
False	! Flag for actinic flux jacobian calculation
aircraft_spherical	! Resolved radiative-transfer backend mode
2	! Resolved sphericity interpolation points for Standard/AC corrections
